main-guard is armed (REQ-GATE-2, non-overridable).

scripts/gates judges a commit on main only if its parent contains this file, so
the PR that added it (#13, the second bootstrap, approved by Delmar 2026-11-15)
was exempt and every commit after it is guarded. Deleting this file would turn
the guard off for later commits: that is a Tier 2 change (.github/**) and needs
Delmar's approval.
